{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:00.02]Juice WRLD, you know I'm here 'cause my ex is a fucking bitch, you know what I'm sayin'?\n[Chorus: Juice WRLD]\n[00:05.06]Wait, huh\n[00:07.14]I just put some money on his head (On his head)\n[00:09.86]I can't say his name 'cause he gon' really get blicked, brrt\n[00:12.32]I've been tryna numb all the pain I've been holdin' it in since a jit\n[00:16.50]Uh, I mix the Rick with the Raf and the Raf with the Rick, uh\n[00:19.60]'Member first time I got stabbed in the heart as a kid, uh\n[00:22.82]It was that day I found out my friend was dead, uh\n[00:25.50]Same day I jumped headfirst in a pill bottle full of meds, uh\n[Verse 1: Juice WRLD]\n[00:28.68]Sorrows symphonies, yeah, I invented that\n[00:31.08]Look at that watch on my wrist (Paid off, no deposit), paid two-hundred and ten for that, yeah\n[00:34.84]Thinking back to the good old days, nowadays I'm over-stressed\n[00:37.38]When I say, \"Good old days,\" I'm talkin' 'bout He-Man, no lil' ThunderCats, huh\n[00:41.34]Wow, I've been down, the devil been on the prowl\n[00:44.30]He loves when I frown, make him and his demons smile\n[00:47.68]On me, they dogpile, I done got way too involved now\n[00:50.44]Hate when they play with me, torture me playfully, I'm finna burn this all down\n[Bridge: Juice WRLD]\n[00:53.64]Bring all guns out, we goin' all out\n[00:56.76]We uppin' heat, enemies gonna fall down\n[00:59.90]Please, nigga, please take a chill pill, calm down\n[01:03.04]With some niggas that be down to kill, kill, and blackout\n[Chorus: Juice WRLD & Offset]\n[01:05.84]Wait, huh (Hey)\n[01:10.30]I just put some money on his head (Money on his top)\n[01:13.04]I can't say his name 'cause he gon' really get blicked, brrt (Brrt)\n[01:15.74]I've been tryna numb all the pain I've been holdin' it in since a jit (Yeah)\n[01:19.66]Uh, I mix the Rick with the Raf and the Raf with the Rick, uh (The Raf with the Rick)\n[01:22.74]'Member first time I got stabbed in the heart as a kid, uh (Hey)\n[01:25.96]It was that day I found out my friend was dead, uh (R.I.P., hey)\n[01:28.82]Same day I jumped headfirst in a pill bottle full of meds, uh (Skrrt, meds)\n[Verse 2: Offset]\n[01:31.94]On my dad (On my dad), on my momma (Momma)\n[01:34.18]These nigga play, I'm goin' Osama (Bin Laden)\n[01:35.90]I'm havin' trauma, spendin' my commas (I got trauma)\n[01:37.58]I been payin' for the dead, I'm a sponsor (I paid for that)\n[01:40.18]Two Percocets to the head, we been lookin', tryna hunt 'em (Where he at?)\n[01:42.98]Poppin' drugs, it's makin' it worse (Worse)\n[01:44.52]Put him in a hearse, end of the month, he get killed on the first (Walk)\n[01:47.04]Walkin' him down, he a demon, he cursed (Walk down)\n[01:48.56]Pull out the wrist work, take off your bitch skirt\n[01:50.10]I do not fear anybody on earth (Why?)\n[01:52.00]Watchin' my back, I'm alert\n[01:53.32]I got pills from the bitch, she a nurse (Nurse)\n[01:54.92]I got water, do you wanna surf? (Do you wanna surf?)\n[01:56.68]I'm on the edge, nigga, don't push me\n[01:57.96]Poppin' the meds, it give me a cushion (Let's go)\n[01:59.60]Everbody fed, I'm handin' out blessings\n[02:01.12]Nobody scared, put switches on weapons (Nobody)\n[02:02.72]All in my head, I'm thinkin' 'bout\n[02:04.28]Niggas tryna X me and cut me out (Cut me out)\n[02:05.84]Feds did a sweep, and we jumpin' out (Jumpin' out)\n[02:07.44]First, you get beat, then we stomp 'em out (Let's go)\n[02:09.10]Takin' the world (World)\n[02:10.22]Diamonds for girls, I bought my momma some pearls, that's my world (Momma)\n[02:13.40]I put my babies in Birkins, like, \"What was the purpose?,\" 'cause them my girls (My babies)\n[02:20.04]Fuck around and put some money in the street (Money in the street)\n[Chorus: Juice WRLD & Offset]\n[02:24.76]Wait, huh\n[02:26.10]I just put some money on his head\n[02:28.80]I can't say his name 'cause he gon' really get blicked, brrt (Brrt)\n[02:31.60]I've been tryna numb all the pain I've been holdin' it in since a jit\n[02:34.06]Uh, I mix the Rick with the Raf and the Raf with the Rick, uh (The Raf with the Rick with the Rick with the Raf)\n[02:38.74]'Member first time I got stabbed in the heart as a kid, uh (Hey, hey)\n[02:41.78]It was that day I found out my friend was dead, uh (R.I.P.)\n[02:44.46]Same day I jumped headfirst in a pill bottle full of meds, uh (Meds)","words":[[0.02,0.16,"Juice"],[0.2,0.36,"WRLD,"],[0.4,0.44,"you"],[0.48,0.58,"know"],[0.62,0.68,"I'm"],[0.74,0.84,"here"],[0.88,1.02,"'cause"],[1.06,1.14,"my"],[1.22,1.32,"ex"],[1.46,1.48,"is"],[1.54,1.54,"a"],[1.6,1.88,"fucking"],[1.94,2.14,"bitch,"],[2.2,2.26,"you"],[2.3,2.4,"know"],[2.44,2.52,"what"],[2.58,2.62,"I'm"],[2.7,3.04,"sayin'?"],[5.06,5.18,"Wait,"],[5.8,7.1,"huh"],[7.14,7.14,"I"],[7.2,7.3,"just"],[7.38,7.5,"put"],[7.58,7.74,"some"],[7.82,8.0,"money"],[8.04,8.06,"on"],[8.1,8.14,"his"],[8.18,8.24,"head"],[8.28,8.32,"(On"],[8.36,8.48,"his"],[8.56,8.86,"head)"],[9.86,9.86,"I"],[9.92,10.12,"can't"],[10.16,10.3,"say"],[10.36,10.46,"his"],[10.54,10.8,"name"],[10.84,11.0,"'cause"],[11.04,11.06,"he"],[11.12,11.3,"gon'"],[11.34,11.46,"really"],[11.52,11.64,"get"],[11.72,11.9,"blicked,"],[12.12,12.28,"brrt"],[12.32,12.64,"I've"],[12.68,12.82,"been"],[12.88,13.18,"tryna"],[13.24,13.32,"numb"],[13.38,13.46,"all"],[13.5,13.56,"the"],[13.66,13.84,"pain"],[13.88,13.94,"I've"],[13.98,14.06,"been"],[14.1,14.32,"holdin'"],[14.36,14.38,"it"],[14.42,14.44,"in"],[14.5,14.72,"since"],[14.8,14.8,"a"],[14.86,15.02,"jit"],[16.5,16.52,"Uh,"],[16.56,16.56,"I"],[16.62,16.72,"mix"],[16.78,16.84,"the"],[16.88,17.02,"Rick"],[17.06,17.16,"with"],[17.2,17.24,"the"],[17.28,17.46,"Raf"],[17.52,17.58,"and"],[17.62,17.66,"the"],[17.7,17.78,"Raf"],[17.86,17.94,"with"],[17.98,18.02,"the"],[18.08,18.26,"Rick,"],[18.48,18.56,"uh"],[19.6,19.76,"'Member"],[19.8,19.98,"first"],[20.02,20.14,"time"],[20.18,20.18,"I"],[20.22,20.28,"got"],[20.36,20.62,"stabbed"],[20.66,20.68,"in"],[20.72,20.76,"the"],[20.8,20.96,"heart"],[21.02,21.08,"as"],[21.14,21.14,"a"],